  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Now that the import-export tool can overwrite server-managed triples if the repository supports it, the current tool should be able to verify RDFsources in imports.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "For repositories that do not support server-managed triple modification, it would be nice if the verification tool respected the legacyMode parameter in the import-export tool config, and did not attempt to verify server-managed triples.  ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In short, it would be nice if the verification tool had a legacyMode of its own.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
